</header>

<!-- ================= HERO ================= -->
<section class="hero" id="top">
  <img class="hero-bg" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1554068865-24cecd4e34b8?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1920&q=80" alt="法网红土球场">
  <div class="wrap hero-inner">
    <h1 data-zh="独特设计的<br>网球社交" data-en="TENNIS WITH A<br>UNIQUE DESIGN">独特设计的<br>网球社交</h1>
    <div class="t-sub" data-zh="红土 · 搭子 · 生活方式" data-en="CLAY · PARTNER · LIFESTYLE">红土 · 搭子 · 生活方式</div>
    <p data-zh="热爱、人群与红土。一段场上场下、独一无二的旅程。" data-en="The passion, the people, the clay. A unique journey, on and off the court.">热爱、人群与红土。一段场上场下、独一无二的旅程。</p>
    <a class="btn" href="#games"><span data-zh="寻找我的球局" data-en="FIND MY NEXT GAME">寻找我的球局</span><span class="arw">→</span></a>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ================= OUR STORY ================= -->
<section class="story" id="story">
  <div class="wrap story-grid">
    <div class="reveal">
      <div class="eyebrow" data-zh="我们的故事" data-en="OUR STORY">我们的故事</div>
      <h2 data-zh="从巴黎红土<br>到一个全球社区" data-en="From Paris Clay<br>to a Global Community">从巴黎红土<br>到一个全球社区</h2>
      <p data-zh="网球搭子不只是一个约球平台——它是一种心态，一个属于所有网球爱好者的聚集地。" data-en="Tennis Partner is more than an app to find games — it's a mindset, and a meeting place for tennis lovers around the world.">网球搭子不只是一个约球平台——它是一种心态，一个属于所有网球爱好者的聚集地。</p>
      <p data-zh="我们把法网红土的传统与浪漫，带到每一位球员的周末、每一场说走就走的球局里。" data-en="Through the spirit of Roland Garros, we bring the romance of clay closer to every player, every weekend, and every dreamer.">我们把法网红土的传统与浪漫，带到每一位球员的周末、每一场说走就走的球局里。</p>
      <a class="link-more" href="#games"><span data-zh="了解更多" data-en="LEARN MORE">了解更多</span> →</a>
    </div>
    <div class="story-visual reveal">
      <div class="logo-rG" title="Roland Garros × Tennis Partner">
        <span class="ring"></span>
        <div class="logo-rG-inner">
          <div class="c">RG</div>
          <div class="w" data-zh="巴黎 · 红土" data-en="PARIS · CLAY">巴黎 · 红土</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <span class="x-mark">×</span>
      <div class="logo-tp">
        <svg class="ball" viewBox="0 0 48 48"><use href="#tp-ball"/></svg>
        <div class="logo-tp-txt">
          <div class="n">TENNIS<br>PARTNER</div>
          <div class="s" data-zh="网球搭子" data-en="网球搭子 · TP">网球搭子</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ================= UPCOMING GAMES ================= -->
<section class="games" id="games">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="games-head reveal">
      <div>
        <h2 data-zh="近期球局" data-en="Upcoming Games">近期球局</h2>
        <div class="bar"></div>
      </div>
      <a class="link-more" href="#games"><span data-zh="查看全部球局" data-en="VIEW ALL EVENTS">查看全部球局</span> →</a>
    </div>
    <div class="cards">

      <div class="card reveal">
        <div class="card-img"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1554068865-24cecd4e34b8?auto=format&fit=crop&w=640&q=70" alt="红土球场"></div>
        <div class="card-body">
          <div class="card-date" data-zh="11月8日 周日 08:00" data-en="NOV 8, SUN 08:00">11月8日 周日 08:00</div>
          <div class="card-title" data-zh="晨光单打局" data-en="Morning Singles">晨光单打局</div>
          <div class="card-meta"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2a7 7 0 0 0-7 7c0 5.25 7 13 7 13s7-7.75 7-13a7 7 0 0 0-7-7zm0 9.5A2.5 2.5 0 1 1 12 6.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 0 5z"/></svg><span data-zh="红土一号球场 · 静安" data-en="Clay Court No.1 · Jing'an">红土一号球场 · 静安</span></div>
          <div class="card-people"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M16 11a4 4 0 1 0-4-4 4 4 0 0 0 4 4zm-8 1a3 3 0 1 0-3-3 3 3 0 0 0 3 3zm8 2c-2.67 0-8 1.34-8 4v3h16v-3c0-2.66-5.33-4-8-4zm-9 1c-1 .64-3 1.63-3 3.5V21h5v-2.5c0-1.35.72-2.5 1.8-3.5z"/></svg><span data-zh="4 / 8 人 · " data-en="4 / 8 players · ">4 / 8 人 · </span><span class="lack" data-zh="还缺 4 人" data-en="4 spots left">还缺 4 人</span></div>
          <button class="btn"><span data-zh="报名" data-en="SIGN UP">报名</span><span class="arw">→</span></button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="card reveal">
        <div class="card-img"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1571019613454-1cb2f99b2d8b?auto=format&fit=crop&w=640&q=70" alt="网球与球拍"></div>
        <div class="card-body">
          <div class="card-date" data-zh="11月9日 周一 19:00" data-en="NOV 9, MON 19:00">11月9日 周一 19:00</div>
